                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is programmatic worth it for D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>For ₹5+ Cr ARR + scaled brands: yes. Retargeting + CTV + brand-building at scale beyond Meta / Google reach. Not for sub-scale brands.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the minimum programmatic budget?</h3>
                                        <p>$10K / month minimum for meaningful testing. Below that, programmatic economics don't work vs efficient Meta / Google.</p>
                                        <h3>DV360 vs The Trade Desk?</h3>
                                        <p>DV360 for Google-ecosystem integrated brands. TTD for independent-preferred + open-web focus. Both viable + similar capability.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I hire in-house programmatic team?</h3>
                                        <p>Rarely — requires 3+ specialists + significant investment. Managed service or specialist agency typically better for D2C.</p>
